Trump.

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:05.000
The the racist right wingers are more willing
than ever to say the things that they were

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.410
probably always thinking, etc..

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:11.870
I am interested in what the sort of sidebar
around the debate, what is going to be the

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:12.870
right wing coverage?

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:16.849
How are they going to deal with Kamala Harris
if Birther 2.0 is any sign?

00:04:16.849 --> 00:04:20.989
The early questions about is Kamala Harris
actually eligible to be V.P.?

00:04:20.989 --> 00:04:28.000
It could get very, very ugly with a woman
