00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.750
white Republican Mike Pence.

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:31.370
That's in September.

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:32.439
Actually, no.

00:04:32.439 --> 00:04:34.939
I believe that the V.P. debate is not even
until October.

00:04:34.939 --> 00:04:37.889
So we have some time unless it gets canceled.

00:04:37.889 --> 00:04:39.229
But I think that's going to be interesting.

00:04:39.229 --> 00:04:40.870
But should Trump replace Pat Pence?

